{
  "id": "6a6fa3358d729847ae69e3ca",
  "title": "自律・分散・協調",
  "created": 1785701199,
  "updated": 1785742705,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a6fa3358d729847ae69e3ca",
      "text": "自律・分散・協調",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785701199,
      "updated": 1785701199
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6fa34f00000000003cdfbe",
      "text": " インターネットの基本精神",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785701199,
      "updated": 1785741174
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6fa35000000000003cdfbf",
      "text": "  [自律]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785701200,
      "updated": 1785742340
    },
    {
      "id": "6a703f7100000000002243c5",
      "text": "   一人ひとりのユーザーや組織が自分で考えて行動する",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785741170,
      "updated": 1785742340
    },
    {
      "id": "6a703f8200000000002243c6",
      "text": "  [分散]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785741186,
      "updated": 1785742340
    },
    {
      "id": "6a703f8900000000002243c7",
      "text": "   中央に一つの強い司令塔を置かず、ネットワークが網の目のようにつながる",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785741194,
      "updated": 1785742340
    },
    {
      "id": "6a703f8f00000000002243c8",
      "text": "  [協調]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785741200,
      "updated": 1785742340
    },
    {
      "id": "6a703f9600000000002243c9",
      "text": "  \tお互いのルールや手順（TCP/IPなど）を守り、助け合ってデータをやり取りする",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785741207,
      "updated": 1785742340
    },
    {
      "id": "6a703f9f00000000002243ca",
      "text": "  [オープン]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785741216,
      "updated": 1785742340
    },
    {
      "id": "6a703fa300000000002243cb",
      "text": "   情報を隠さず、誰でも平等に参加や接続ができる",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785741219,
      "updated": 1785742340
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7043f600000000000a2c0b",
      "text": "　[中央集権]的な管理を排し、個々の主体が自立しながら全体最適を目指すという思想をあらわす場合もある",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785742326,
      "updated": 1785742705
    },
    {
      "id": "6a70442100000000000a2c0c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785742370,
      "updated": 1785742370
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6fa5a700000000003cdfc0",
      "text": "[ラフコンセンサスと動くコード]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1785701799,
      "updated": 1785742370
    }
  ]
}